      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "CAUTION:",
      "page_pdf": 206,
      "page_manual": "EVB-206",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        72.000012,
        301.316238,
        123.13617599999996,
        292.0726504640884
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When cutting the adhesive, be careful to avoid scratching the battery pack coating to the maximum extent possible.",
      "page_pdf": 206,
      "page_manual": "EVB-206",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        72.000012,
        289.795698,
        558.5305295999997,
        269.03271886408834
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The paint sealant is set between the paint sealant marks stamped on the battery pack upper case (between to ). Therefore be careful not to damage the paint sealant when cutting the adhesive.",
      "page_pdf": 206,
      "page_manual": "EVB-206",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        71.99990759999997,
        266.8163184,
        558.5154959999998,
        233.03361526408844
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Because the paint sealant functions to release pressure from inside the battery pack, if the paint sealant is damaged beyond the limit, the battery pack lower case must be replaced. If the paint sealant  damage  is  less  than  the  limit,  repair  by  applying  primer  (adhesive  primer:  999MP43533PP).",
      "page_pdf": 206,
      "page_manual": "EVB-206",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        71.99980319999997,
        230.7578112,
        558.6917232000008,
        187.0154524640884
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Paint sealant damage limit:",
      "page_pdf": 206,
      "page_manual": "EVB-206",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        86.52,
        171.77592000000004,
        221.45804400000011,
        162.53233246408843
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Continuous length of undamaged section: : 210 mm (8.27 in) or more",
      "page_pdf": 206,
      "page_manual": "EVB-206",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        98.580288,
        156.29548799999998,
        444.4725215999992,
        147.05190046408836
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "NOTE:",
      "page_pdf": 206,
      "page_manual": "EVB-206",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        71.99980319999997,
        138.83903999999995,
        104.52082079999997,
        129.59545246408834
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Because there is no clearance at the embossed part, cut the adhesive there last.",
      "page_pdf": 206,
      "page_manual": "EVB-206",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        71.99980319999997,
        127.31849999999997,
        453.2874996000004,
        118.07491246408836
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Battery pack lower case",
      "page_pdf": 206,
      "page_manual": "EVB-206",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        244.63984867430008,
        370.21426718,
        334.43295661260004,
        362.72376497792266
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Adhesive",
      "page_pdf": 206,
      "page_manual": "EVB-206",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        244.72478717470003,
        353.7139482761,
        279.55236414200016,
        346.22344607402266
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "LI-ION BATTERY",
      "page_pdf": 207,
      "page_manual": "EVB-207",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        252.17998,
        769.00991,
        359.8315575999998,
        757.1101191491713
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "< UNIT DISASSEMBLY AND ASSEMBLY >",
      "page_pdf": 207,
      "page_manual": "EVB-207",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        52.44,
        751.4636,
        266.2087416,
        741.7418958674033
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Set the windshield cutter (A) at an angle of 90 ° to the surface of the battery case.",
      "page_pdf": 207,
      "page_manual": "EVB-207",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        73.26001,
        738.83217,
        456.0187024000002,
        726.05361
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A",
      "page_pdf": 207,
      "page_manual": "EVB-207",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        574.2598966408999,
        722.9521007590001,
        580.9032233108999,
        714.1334968994641
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "B",
      "page_pdf": 207,
      "page_manual": "EVB-207",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        574.2598966408999,
        683.2923369400002,
        580.9032233108999,
        674.4737330804642
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "EVB",
      "page_pdf": 207,
      "page_manual": "EVB-207",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        568.37988,
        643.6912671800001,
        588.3435248437999,
        634.8726633204641
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "D",
      "page_pdf": 207,
      "page_manual": "EVB-207",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        574.01996,
        603.8512971800001,
        581.21108722,
        595.0326933204641
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hold the windshield cutter facing toward the grip, and cut the adhesive while holding the blade level.",
      "page_pdf": 207,
      "page_manual": "EVB-207",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        73.2598012,
        593.995962,
        543.7467532000004,
        584.7523744640885
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Use piano wire (A) to cut the adhesive at the battery pack corners.",
      "page_pdf": 207,
      "page_manual": "EVB-207",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        53.4591928,
        571.495674,
        369.5197528000005,
        550.7326948640886
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "CAUTION:",
      "page_pdf": 207,
      "page_manual": "EVB-207",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        73.2598012,
        548.4568908000001,
        124.43668120000001,
        539.2133032640886
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When cutting the adhesive, be careful to avoid scratching the battery pack coating and paint sealant to the maximum extent possible. NOTE:",
      "page_pdf": 207,
      "page_manual": "EVB-207",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        73.2598012,
        536.9969028000002,
        369.5685076000001,
        493.25339566408866
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Press the piano wire against the adhesive at the battery pack corner, and pull it in alternate directions for cutting of adhesive.",
      "page_pdf": 207,
      "page_manual": "EVB-207",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        73.2598012,
        490.97759160000027,
        369.5887612000002,
        470.21461246408865
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Use the windshield cutter (A) for cutting adhesive at the embossed locations.",
      "page_pdf": 207,
      "page_manual": "EVB-207",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        53.4591928,
        429.05795160000025,
        428.17052440000066,
        419.81436406408864
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Insert a plastic remover tool (B) into the embossed locations to open a clearance. CAUTION:",
      "page_pdf": 207,
      "page_manual": "EVB-207",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        53.4591928,
        297.1777836000003,
        449.00364880000075,
        276.47420806408866
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Do not press the remover tool farther in than necessary. Doing so may deform the battery pack upper case.",
      "page_pdf": 207,
      "page_manual": "EVB-207",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        73.25980119999997,
        274.1984040000002,
        559.7907363999997,
        253.4342764640886
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Tilt the windshield cutter blade at an angle and cut the adhesive at the embossed locations. CAUTION:",
      "page_pdf": 207,
      "page_manual": "EVB-207",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        53.45919279999997,
        248.2174200000003,
        495.44076880000046,
        227.4544408640886
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When cutting the adhesive, be careful to avoid scratching the battery pack coating to the maximum extent possible.",
      "page_pdf": 207,
      "page_manual": "EVB-207",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        73.25980119999991,
        225.17863680000028,
        559.8614151999999,
        204.4750612640886
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove the battery pack upper case.",
      "page_pdf": 207,
      "page_manual": "EVB-207",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        53.45919279999991,
        199.19880120000028,
        246.97043920000002,
        189.95521366408866
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "WARNING:",
      "page_pdf": 207,
      "page_manual": "EVB-207",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        73.25980119999991,
        184.67895360000023,
        127.30976919999992,
        175.4353660640886
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "To prevent electric shock, wear insulated protective gear.",
      "page_pdf": 207,
      "page_manual": "EVB-207",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        100.13977359999991,
        162.41878560000032,
        384.4659700000001,
        153.1751980640886
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "CAUTION:",
      "page_pdf": 207,
      "page_manual": "EVB-207",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        73.26000999999988,
        115.7989656000002,
        124.43688999999989,
        106.5553780640887
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Check that the adhesive is fully cut before removing. Use of excessive force during removal may deform the battery pack upper case.",
      "page_pdf": 207,
      "page_manual": "EVB-207",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        73.26000999999988,
        104.27957400000025,
        559.8663219999994,
        83.51544646408865
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When removing the battery pack upper case, be careful that cutting particles do not enter the battery pack.",
      "page_pdf": 207,
      "page_manual": "EVB-207",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        73.26000999999988,
        81.29904600000032,
        559.8809379999999,
        60.53606686408864
      ]
    },
    {
