      "bbox": [
        574.7999283830999,
        286.811230867,
        580.3376939430999,
        277.9926270074641
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "M",
      "page_pdf": 207,
      "page_manual": "EVB-207",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        573.4801274579999,
        246.67129496589996,
        581.7768157879999,
        237.8526911063641
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "N",
      "page_pdf": 207,
      "page_manual": "EVB-207",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        573.899717542,
        206.77042890489997,
        581.090844762,
        197.9518250453641
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "O",
      "page_pdf": 207,
      "page_manual": "EVB-207",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        573.5998216409,
        166.8706288449,
        581.3487094209,
        158.05202498536403
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "P",
      "page_pdf": 207,
      "page_manual": "EVB-207",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        574.1396541829,
        126.97082878489994,
        580.7829808529,
        118.15222492536407
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "< UNIT DISASSEMBLY AND ASSEMBLY >",
      "page_pdf": 208,
      "page_manual": "EVB-208",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        751.4636,
        265.84890060000004,
        741.7418958674033
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "If  adhesive cutting particles enter the battery pack, clean (use of air blow is prohibited) when assembling so that no particles remain on the battery module, bus bar, and high-voltage harness.",
      "page_pdf": 208,
      "page_manual": "EVB-208",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        735.83589,
        558.5999435999998,
        703.6129228640885
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Operation must be performed by 2 persons. Be careful that the battery pack upper case does not contact the battery module.",
      "page_pdf": 208,
      "page_manual": "EVB-208",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        71.99979120000003,
        701.3371188000001,
        558.5267591999999,
        680.5729912640886
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "INSTALLATION",
      "page_pdf": 208,
      "page_manual": "EVB-208",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        672.36829718,
        132.09992777300008,
        662.2215916630055
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "To remove remaining adhesive on the battery pack upper case and battery pack lower case ,  use a scraper (B), and cut so that the surface is smooth, leaving approximately 1 - 2 mm (0.04 - 0.08 in) of adhesive behind.",
      "page_pdf": 208,
      "page_manual": "EVB-208",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        654.89594,
        558.5272932000005,
        621.7113444640885
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "CAUTION:",
      "page_pdf": 208,
      "page_manual": "EVB-208",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        72.000012,
        502.13472800000005,
        123.13617599999996,
        492.89114046408844
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Because airtightness leakage is likely to occur, cut the seal in such a way that burrs are not produced.",
      "page_pdf": 208,
      "page_manual": "EVB-208",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        72.000012,
        490.61533640000005,
        558.4356300000001,
        469.8523572640884
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Be careful not to damage the paint sealant.",
      "page_pdf": 208,
      "page_manual": "EVB-208",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        72.00011639999997,
        467.63595680000003,
        293.6429867999998,
        458.3923692640884
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "-If the paint sealant on a straight section is damaged in excess of the limit, the battery pack lower case must be replaced. If  the  paint  sealant  damage  is  less  than  the  limit,  repair  by  applying primer (adhesive primer: 999MP-43533PP).",
      "page_pdf": 208,
      "page_manual": "EVB-208",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        72.00011639999997,
        456.11541680000005,
        558.6026699999994,
        423.8924496640884
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Paint sealant damage limit:",
      "page_pdf": 208,
      "page_manual": "EVB-208",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        86.51996400000002,
        408.5983832,
        221.45800800000015,
        399.3547956640884
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Continuous length of undamaged section: : 210 mm (8.27 in) or more",
      "page_pdf": 208,
      "page_manual": "EVB-208",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        98.58025200000002,
        393.1179512,
        459.40836719999993,
        383.8743636640884
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "-If the paint sealant damage on a corner is damaged, repair by applying primer (adhesive primer: 999MP-43533PP).",
      "page_pdf": 208,
      "page_manual": "EVB-208",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        72.00011639999997,
        375.6564248,
        558.5296943999999,
        354.8922972640884
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "NOTE:",
      "page_pdf": 208,
      "page_manual": "EVB-208",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        72.00011640000002,
        352.67589680000003,
        104.52113400000002,
        343.4323092640884
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Leave 1 - 2 mm (0.04 - 0.08 in) of adhesive so that the battery pack coating surface and paint sealant are not damaged.",
      "page_pdf": 208,
      "page_manual": "EVB-208",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        72.00011640000002,
        341.1565052,
        558.5311559999996,
        320.39237766408843
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sharpen the blade of the scraper.",
      "page_pdf": 208,
      "page_manual": "EVB-208",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        72.00011640000002,
        318.17597720000003,
        235.31512440000026,
        308.9323896640884
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Repair scratches to the battery pack upper case by the following procedure.",
      "page_pdf": 208,
      "page_manual": "EVB-208",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        52.14010440000003,
        303.65612960000004,
        422.0219964000006,
        294.4125420640884
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Protect the seal with masking tape . NOTE:",
      "page_pdf": 208,
      "page_manual": "EVB-208",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        52.14010440000003,
        288.23614520000007,
        246.9567684000002,
        267.47316606408845
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "If  primer surfacer (anti-corrosion primer) contacts the seal, the adhesive strength is reduced.",
      "page_pdf": 208,
      "page_manual": "EVB-208",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        72.00011640000002,
        265.1973620000001,
        368.19794999999976,
        244.49378646408843
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Spray primer surfacer (anti-corrosion primer) (B) into the cracks in the battery pack upper case.",
      "page_pdf": 208,
      "page_manual": "EVB-208",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        52.14010440000003,
        239.2175264,
        368.18249879999985,
        218.45454726408843
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "LI-ION BATTERY",
      "page_pdf": 209,
      "page_manual": "EVB-209",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        252.17998,
        769.00991,
        359.8315575999998,
        757.1101191491713
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "< UNIT DISASSEMBLY AND ASSEMBLY >",
      "page_pdf": 209,
      "page_manual": "EVB-209",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        52.44,
        751.4636,
        266.2087416,
        741.7418958674033
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Install a carabiner (A) onto the bracket of the battery pack upper case.",
      "page_pdf": 209,
      "page_manual": "EVB-209",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        53.46001,
        735.83589,
        369.6145300000002,
        715.0729108640885
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "NOTE:",
      "page_pdf": 209,
      "page_manual": "EVB-209",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        73.25946999999996,
        712.8565104,
        105.83853399999998,
        703.6129228640885
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "This is to provide a handle for use after the adhesive is applied and prevent adhesive from adhering to the operator's hands.",
      "page_pdf": 209,
      "page_manual": "EVB-209",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        73.25946999999996,
        701.3371188000001,
        369.5579452000005,
        680.5741396640886
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "EVB",
      "page_pdf": 209,
      "page_manual": "EVB-209",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        568.37988,
        643.6912671800001,
        588.3435248437999,
        634.8726633204641
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "D",
      "page_pdf": 209,
      "page_manual": "EVB-209",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        574.01996,
        603.8512971800001,
        581.21108722,
        595.0326933204641
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Apply dam rubber (KA390-0059U) on the inside of the old adhesive on the battery pack lower case.",
      "page_pdf": 209,
      "page_manual": "EVB-209",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        53.45886159999996,
        592.4980308000002,
        557.9207056,
        583.2544432640886
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "C : 10 mm (0.39 in)",
      "page_pdf": 209,
      "page_manual": "EVB-209",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "caption",
      "bbox": [
        87.84,
        450.55426718,
        169.0743696216002,
        443.0637649779227
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "WARNING:",
      "page_pdf": 209,
      "page_manual": "EVB-209",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        73.25832159999999,
        435.1180584000002,
        127.3082896,
        425.8744708640886
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "To prevent electric shock, wear insulated protective gear.",
      "page_pdf": 209,
      "page_manual": "EVB-209",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        100.13829399999999,
        412.8578904000002,
        384.46449040000016,
        403.6143028640886
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "CAUTION:",
      "page_pdf": 209,
      "page_manual": "EVB-209",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        73.25853039999996,
        366.2380704000002,
        124.43541039999997,
        356.9944828640886
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "If dam rubber is already applied there, replace it with new dam rubber. NOTE:",
      "page_pdf": 209,
      "page_manual": "EVB-209",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        73.25853039999996,
        354.7186788000002,
        421.1736183999994,
        333.95569966408857
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Apply the dam rubber so that adhesive does not enter the inner side. If the adhesive enters the inner side, then the next time the battery pack is disassembled, the windshield cutter may not be able to reach the adhesive and removing the battery pack upper case may be difficult.",
      "page_pdf": 209,
      "page_manual": "EVB-209",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        73.25853039999996,
        331.7392992000002,
        559.7989659999998,
        299.45692846408855
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Apply adhesive (999MP-57302NP) to the battery pack lower case as shown in the figure.",
      "page_pdf": 209,
      "page_manual": "EVB-209",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        53.457921999999954,
        286.20022800000015,
        483.8583015999998,
        276.95664046408854
      ]
    },
