      ]
    },
    {
      "text": ": 5 mm (0.20 in)",
      "page_pdf": 210,
      "page_manual": "EVB-210",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        83.160942072,
        244.39438717999997,
        142.51975623599998,
        236.90388497792264
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": ": Old adhesive",
      "page_pdf": 210,
      "page_manual": "EVB-210",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        83.160096071,
        230.89474922299996,
        137.31448128320002,
        223.40424702092264
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": ": 50 mm (1.97 in) or more",
      "page_pdf": 210,
      "page_manual": "EVB-210",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        83.15925007,
        214.45441179,
        178.64518333740006,
        206.96390958792267
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "CAUTION:",
      "page_pdf": 210,
      "page_manual": "EVB-210",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        197.03602,
        123.13616399999997,
        187.7924324640884
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Because there is a risk of airtightness leakage, apply the adhesive so that there are no seams or overlaps.",
      "page_pdf": 210,
      "page_manual": "EVB-210",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        185.51662839999995,
        558.6478631999998,
        164.81305286408838
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Complete installation of the battery pack upper case before the adhesive surface hardens. The adhesive begins to harden in as little as 12 minutes. [Humidity: 80%, Temperature: 35 ° C (95 ° F)]",
      "page_pdf": 210,
      "page_manual": "EVB-210",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        162.53724880000004,
        558.5705028000001,
        141.23557719999997
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Before installing the battery pack upper case, check that there are no locations of insufficient adhesive. If there is insufficient adhesive, correct the location. (If the adhesive height is lower than the height of the dam rubber, then the amount of adhesive is insufficient.)",
      "page_pdf": 210,
      "page_manual": "EVB-210",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        139.5578691999999,
        558.5834483999997,
        107.27549846408829
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Do not apply too much adhesive as doing so may make work difficult the next time the battery pack upper case is removed.",
      "page_pdf": 210,
      "page_manual": "EVB-210",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        72.00083519999998,
        105.05909799999995,
        558.5339628000004,
        84.29611886408838
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "NOTE:",
      "page_pdf": 210,
      "page_manual": "EVB-210",
